
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create a company (id = 1)
POST {{host}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Romashka LLP", "bin": "123456789012", "phone": "+77011234567" }

### 2. Create a second company (id = 2)
POST {{host}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ABC JSC", "bin": "210987654321", "phone": "+77017654321" }

### 3. List companies: status filter and pagination
GET {{host}}/companies?status=new&page=0&size=10

### 4. Call: no answer (company 2)
POST {{host}}/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": 2, "result": "no_answer", "comment": "nobody picked up" }

### 5. Call: meeting set (company 1, manager 1, 10:00 Almaty). The meeting is created inside, meeting id = 1
POST {{host}}/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": 1,
  "result": "meeting_set",
  "meeting": { "managerId": 1, "startAt": "2026-11-25T05:00:00Z" },
  "comment": "agreed on Wednesday"
}

### 6. Create a meeting directly (company 2, manager 2, 12:00 Almaty), meeting id = 2
POST {{host}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": 2, "managerId": 2, "startAt": "2026-11-25T07:00:00Z" }

### 7. Get a meeting (initialStartAt and history)
GET {{host}}/meetings/1

### 8. Reschedule meeting 1 to 11:00 Almaty (initialStartAt stays 10:00)
PATCH {{host}}/meetings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startAt": "2026-11-25T06:00:00Z" }

### 9. Cancel meeting 2
PATCH {{host}}/meetings/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "cancelled", "reason": "client changed their mind" }

### 10. Manager schedule for a day (calendar day in Asia/Almaty)
GET {{host}}/managers/1/schedule?date=2026-11-25

### ---------------- Errors ----------------

### 409 MANAGER_BUSY: manager 1 is busy 11:00-12:00 Almaty, 11:30 overlaps
POST {{host}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": 2, "managerId": 1, "startAt": "2026-11-25T06:30:00Z" }

### 409 COMPANY_BUSY: company 1 already has a meeting at that time, even with another manager
POST {{host}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": 1, "managerId": 2, "startAt": "2026-11-25T06:30:00Z" }

### 422 OUTSIDE_WORKING_HOURS: 17:30 Almaty does not fit before 18:00
POST {{host}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": 2, "managerId": 2, "startAt": "2026-11-25T12:30:00Z" }

### 422 OUTSIDE_WORKING_HOURS: Saturday
POST {{host}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": 2, "managerId": 2, "startAt": "2026-11-28T05:00:00Z" }

### 422 MEETING_REQUIRED: meeting_set without a meeting
POST {{host}}/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": 2, "result": "meeting_set" }

### 422 MEETING_NOT_ALLOWED: refused with a meeting block
POST {{host}}/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": 2,
  "result": "refused",
  "meeting": { "managerId": 3, "startAt": "2026-11-26T05:00:00Z" }
}

### 409 BIN_ALREADY_EXISTS
POST {{host}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Duplicate", "bin": "123456789012", "phone": "+77010000000" }

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR: BIN is not 12 digits
POST {{host}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bad BIN", "bin": "123", "phone": "+77010000000" }

### 404 NOT_FOUND: call for a missing company
POST {{host}}/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": 999999, "result": "no_answer" }

### 404 NOT_FOUND: schedule of a missing manager
GET {{host}}/managers/999999/schedule?date=2026-11-25

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR: malformed date
GET {{host}}/managers/1/schedule?date=not-a-date
